.vercel
.env*

# Scratch scripts from investigation sessions. They are useful locally but must
# never reach api/ or a deploy — see .vercelignore.
audit-*.mjs
api/_*

# Scratch files: probes and one-off harnesses that pile up beside the real tests.
# They are not test suites — one of them was a fourth copy of the parser that printed
# "SELF-VALIDATED - safe to push" while exercising code that had not shipped for two
# changes. run-tests.mjs takes its list from git ls-files, so untracked is the same as
# invisible to the suite; keeping them untracked is deliberate.
harness_convert.mjs
gen_report.cjs
test-debug-bens.mjs
test-diag.mjs
test-excel.mjs
test-filename.mjs
test-fixes.mjs
test-new-b2c.mjs
test-parser.mjs
test-realparse.mjs
*.xlsx
*.xls
AUDIT.md
PROJECT-BLUEPRINT.md
*.pdf
_screens-bundle.mjs

# My own scratch probes. Named with a leading underscore so one pattern covers them, and
# so `git add -A` can never sweep them in again — it has three times now.
_*.mjs
_*.txt
_*.js
_*.jsx
_*.md
.claude/
